== Notes ==
- The successful update is 01a05769-... (resultCode OK, success true,
  "Device has been successfully installed", completedAt 2026-08-31T10:43:17Z).
- The four earlier "Completed / INSTALL_FAILED" records (01a05759, 01a0575c, 01a05764,
  01a05767) are the on-device download iterations BEFORE the device firmware learned to
  follow Torizon's 302-to-object-storage redirect. Root causes, fixed in aktualino_net:
    1. manual open()/fetch_headers()/read() streaming flow does not auto-follow 3xx;
    2. Location header not retained by esp_http_client_get_header in that flow
       (captured via an HTTP_EVENT_ON_HEADER handler instead);
    3. the presigned S3 URL (~1.5 KB query) overflowed the 512-byte TX buffer
       ("Out of buffer") -> buffer_size_tx raised to 4096 on the redirect leg;
    plus CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CERTIFICATE_BUNDLE enabled (FULL) so the Amazon S3 root validates.
- The Director admin API (GET /director/api/v1/admin/devices/<uuid>/ecus) is 403 for this
  USER-scoped Platform API token (it was 200 for the repo-scoped garage-tools token used in
  Stage 3). The Platform API v2 device/update views above are the authoritative confirmation.
